      "content": "To track potential unauthorized access, first log into your smart home hub or the respective apps for your thermostat and Hue lights. Look specifically for \"activity logs,\" \"event history,\" or \"remote access logs\" within the account security or settings sections. These logs should detail when commands were sent, what changes were made, and from where, which will help you spot strange activity patterns. Reviewing these logs is the best way to determine if an external entity is interfering with your device settings.",
